---
schedule: "@hourly"
subscription:
  webhook: /webhooks/process-data
---
Process incoming data from external systems via webhook.

This task will be triggered whenever data is POSTed to /webhooks/process-data.
The payload will be available in the ANVIL_WEBHOOK_PAYLOAD environment variable.

Example usage:
  curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/webhooks/process-data \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -d '{"event": "data_received", "timestamp": "2026-03-03T10:00:00Z"}'